## Quick Reference

All detailed documentation is in `.agent/`:

- **Rules**: `.agent/rules/critical-rules.md` - Import conventions, architecture, naming, styling, localization
- **Patterns**: `.agent/patterns/` - Clean architecture, MVI patterns
- **Skills**: `.agent/skills/` - Automation for API integration, model generation, feature creation
- **Workflows**: `.agent/workflows/` - Step-by-step procedures for common tasks
- **Templates**: `.agent/templates/` - Structured guides for features, bugs, refactoring, UI updates
- **Checklists**: `.agent/checklists/` - Pre-submission verification

---

## Essential Commands

```bash
# Code generation (after any model/theme/locale changes)
melos genAlls

# Format code
dart format lib/

# Analyze (MUST have 0 issues before submitting)
fvm flutter analyze --no-fatal-infos
```

